infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title When to reach for which
  desc Server actions for in-app form & button mutations; route handlers for any external caller
  compares
    - label Server actions
      children
        - label In-app mutations
          desc From your own React tree — form and button submits
        - label Work pre-hydration
          desc Plain POST upgrades to RPC once JS arrives
        - label POST-only, opaque id
          desc Per-build action id — not a stable contract
        - label Sequential per client
          desc Mutation primitive, not parallel data fetching
        - label Refresh the Router Cache
          desc revalidate updates the caller's UI in the same trip
    - label Route handlers
      children
        - label External callers
          desc Webhooks, native mobile, third-party integrations
        - label Stable URL + methods
          desc A documented endpoint, an OpenAPI row to integrate
        - label GET + raw responses
          desc Files, custom headers, specific status codes
        - label Requests run in parallel
          desc High-concurrency firing, no per-client queue
        - label revalidate works here too
          desc But can't reach into any browser's Router Cache
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6
